  <!-- THE RIGHT-HAND COUNTERPART, authored as the MIRROR of `Left Arm Turn 3/4`: the formation is the mirror
       of `Ocean Waves LH BGBG` (`Ocean Waves RH GBGB`) and the move is the mirror (`Cast Right` for
       `Cast Left`). MEASURED before it was written: the completed end board is exactly the mirror of the left
       call's end board, and every dancer's heading changes by +90 degrees, where the left call changes it by
       -90 - i.e. 270 degrees the other way. `poc/tools/arm-turn-probe.mjs` pins the pairing. -->
  <tam title="Right Arm Turn 3/4" group=" "
